Z||000009||DecadenceR||07-05-2001||11:45 AM||||The Kia Sportage is terrible, and prssibly one of the worst SUVs made.<BR>I noticed from selling cars that most average people, when you tell them the offroading capabilities of a vehicle, their eyes light up, and they want the vehicle. Tehn you ask them where they live, and it's in the middle of a metropolitan city...||||reg||1
Z||000010||Monkeyman||07-05-2001||02:19 PM||||I'm all for some of the "off road" packages.  Most of them include some heavy duty stuff although I agree that the skid plates probably aren't needed in Metropolis, USA.  Some of that stuff really looks good, though.  (Nerf bars on a Fiero?)<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
