Z||000012||DecadenceR||07-05-2001||06:52 PM||||If they changed the front end it wouldn't be too bad. Pretty much looks like a Grand Vitara except the front end. And a Jeep in that price range is good. I used to sell Mazda, Isuzu, and Suzukis. And we sold all the Grand Vitaras to people that wanted a Rodeo but couldnt' afford it.||||reg||1
